  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0: New convert_to_markdown and convert_directory_to_markdown tools — parse DOCX, HWPX, XLSX, PPTX, or PDF documents directly to markdown on disk without round-tripping through the LLM context. FieldCure.DocumentParsers upgraded to 2.x (PDF text extraction is now part of the core package; OCR is not bundled — use fieldcure-mcp-rag for scanned PDFs).",
